{"path":"string/wide/iswctype","title":"iswctype","titleHtml":"iswctype","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/c/string/wide/iswctype","section":"string","kind":"page","summary":"Classifies the wide character wc using the current C locale's LC_CTYPE category identified by desc.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/c/string/wide\"><code>&lt;wctype.h&gt;</code></a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\"><span class=\"kw4\">int</span> iswctype<span class=\"br0\">(</span> wint_t wc, wctype_t desc <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c95\">(since C95)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Classifies the wide character <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\">wc</span></code> using the current C locale's <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/c/locale/LC_categories\">LC_CTYPE</a></span> category identified by <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\">desc</span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> wc\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> the wide character to classify\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> desc\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> the <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/c/locale/LC_categories\">LC_CTYPE</a></span> category, obtained from a call to <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/c/string/wide/wctype\">wctype</a></span>\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>Non-zero if the character <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\">wc</span></code> has the property identified by <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\">desc</span></code> in <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/c/locale/LC_categories\">LC_CTYPE</a></span> facet of the current C locale, zero otherwise.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"c\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;locale.h&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;wchar.h&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;wctype.h&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">char</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span> classify<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">wchar_t</span> wc, <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">char</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span> cat<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> iswctype<span class=\"br0\">(</span>wc, <a href=\"/w/c/string/wide/wctype\"><span class=\"kw605\">wctype</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>cat<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy4\">?</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"true\"</span> <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"false\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">void</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/c/locale/setlocale\"><span class=\"kw900\">setlocale</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/c/locale/LC_categories\"><span class=\"kw903\">LC_ALL</span></a>, <span class=\"st0\">\"ja_JP.UTF-8\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/c/io/puts\"><span class=\"kw835\">puts</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"The character <span class=\"es3\">\\u6c34</span> is...\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">char</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span> cats<span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span> <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"st0\">\"digit\"</span>, <span class=\"st0\">\"alpha\"</span>, <span class=\"st0\">\"space\"</span>, <span class=\"st0\">\"cntrl\"</span>, <span class=\"st0\">\"jkanji\"</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">for</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span> n <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> n <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"nu0\">5</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"sy2\">++</span>n<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/c/io/fprintf\"><span class=\"kw850\">printf</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"%s?<span class=\"es1\">\\t</span>%s<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span>, cats<span class=\"br0\">[</span>n<span class=\"br0\">]</span>, classify<span class=\"br0\">(</span>L<span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es3\">\\u6c34</span>'</span>, cats<span class=\"br0\">[</span>n<span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>The character 水 is...\ndigit?  false\nalpha?  true\nspace?  false\ncntrl?  false\njkanji? true</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"References\">References</h3>\n<div class=\"t-ref-std-23\">\n<ul><li> C23 standard (ISO/IEC 9899:2024): \n</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 7.30.2.2.1 The iswctype function (p: TBD)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<div class=\"t-ref-std-17\">\n<ul><li> C17 standard (ISO/IEC 9899:2018): \n</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 7.30.2.2.1 The iswctype function (p: TBD)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<div class=\"t-ref-std-11\">\n<ul><li> C11 standard (ISO/IEC 9899:2011): \n</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 7.30.2.2.1 The iswctype function (p: 451-452)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<div class=\"t-ref-std-c99\">\n<ul><li> C99 standard (ISO/IEC 9899:1999): \n</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 7.25.2.2.1 The iswctype function (p: 397-398)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/c/string/wide/wctype\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>wctype</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c95\">(C95)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>   looks up a character classification category in the current C locale <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"References","id":"References"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C reference"},{"path":"string","title":"Strings library"},{"path":"string/wide","title":"Null-terminated wide strings"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"iswctype","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. Classifies the wide character wc using the current C locale's LC_CTYPE category identified by desc."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"wc, desc"},{"label":"Return value","note":"Non-zero if the character wc has the property identified by desc in LC_CTYPE facet of the current C locale, zero otherwise."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"wctype","note":"looks up a character classification category in the current C locale"}]}]},"standards":["C95"],"wordCount":198,"codeBlockCount":2}
